# Loaded by `expo start`. EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL is deliberately unset: in
# development the app derives the API from wherever it was served - port 8787 on
# the host that served the bundle, which is localhost in a browser and this
# machine's LAN address on a phone running Expo Go (see src/lib/config.ts). Set
# it here to override that, e.g. to point the app at the deployed API.

# Cloudflare's always-passes test site key: a real managed widget that solves
# itself, with no hostname to register. Pairs with the test secret in
# .dev.vars.example. https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/troubleshooting/testing/
EXPO_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=1x00000000000000000000AA
